no-eorg-popup-label = Join our team!
no-eorg-popup-message = Become the shield of our server and get an exclusive donor role along with special bonuses right after your internship (subject to active participation)! We are looking for driven and active players (even beginners) who are ready to pacify chaos, create something new, and help players as part of our friendly team. Leave an application in Discord via a ticket in the "become a volunteer" category and start your journey in the project team right now!
no-eorg-popup-rule = [bold][color=#a4885c]Recruitment for the volunteer team![/color][/bold]
no-eorg-popup-close-button = Got it!
no-eorg-popup-close-button-wait = The close button will be enabled after {$time} seconds.
no-eorg-popup-skip-checkbox = Don't show this again.

cmd-toggleeorgpopup-desc = Enable or disable the volunteer recruitment popup in the lobby.
cmd-toggleeorgpopup-help = Usage: toggleeorgpopup <true/false>
